OL,3,GNEWSALondon Stadium 'should be sold to
OL,4,AWest Ham'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deal allowing West Ham United to
OL,7,Frent the London Stadium in Queen
OL,8,FElizabeth Park has been "disastrous"
OL,9,Ffor taxpayers and the venue should be
OL,10,Fsold to the club, a London Assembly
OL,11,Fmember has said.
OL,13,FLabour's Bassam Mahfouz has written to
OL,14,FLord Sadiq Khan urging the mayor to
OL,15,Fconsider a sale to stop the stadium
OL,16,Flosing millions of pounds a year.
OL,18,FThe stadium is run by London Stadium
OL,19,FLLP, which is wholly owned by the
OL,20,FGreater London Authority, so its losses
OL,21,Fof about #19m a year are ultimately met
OL,22,Fby the public purse.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
