OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALondon Stadium 'should be sold to
OL,4,AWest Ham'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the mayor said he
OL,7,Fwould consider "any credible proposal"
OL,8,Fthat offered value for taxpayers and
OL,9,Fprotected the public interest. West Ham
OL,10,Fdeclined to comment.
